Example catalog
===============

.. This page describes a tiny in-memory catalog of example files.

The catalog holds two files. Each entry has a *name* and a size in
**bytes**; see `the online copy <https://example.com/catalog>`_.

==============  =====
Name            Bytes
==============  =====
``notes.md``      120
``letter.eml``    240
==============  =====

.. note::
   Sizes are counted before line endings are converted.

Printing labels
---------------

.. code-block:: python

   for name, size in [("notes.md", 120), ("letter.eml", 240)]:
       print(f"{name}: {size} bytes")
